WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.770
If you take injectable GLP-1 medications or other weight loss drugs such as

2
00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:05.680
phentermine,

3
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.410
there's an important step to be aware of before your procedure. These

4
00:00:09.410 --> 00:00:12.080
medications slow digestion,

5
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:16.110
which can affect how your stomach empties and may interfere with your prep. For

6
00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:16.960
that reason,

7
00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:22.860
your care team may ask you to hold your GLP-1 before your colonoscopy. Typically

8
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:23.520
, you will need to

9
00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:27.550
hold your dose for one week, but if you are not sure, please call your doctor's

10
00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:28.720
office to confirm

11
00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:33.520
exactly when to take your last dose. Do not stop or adjust any medication

12
00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.720
without speaking with

13
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:39.160
them first. We just want to make sure everything goes smoothly on procedure day

14
00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:39.440
.
